WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.690
Wuro n'a ka piyɔniyew. Bwabaw ka kibaroya lo.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.152
Wuro ye lolow bɛɛ kelen kelen mana sufɛ.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.330
A ka dugukolo lajigi, k'a to bajiw ye woyo; a ka yiriw falen ni fɔɲɔ le ye.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.330
O wagati la, sankolo tun be ɲini ka yɛlɛ boonw kunna. Wuro tun be tagama cɛw cɛma.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.658
Tiko tun ye denmisɛn dɔ ye dugu kɔnɔ. Wuro y'a kɔrɔta fɔɔ sankolo la.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.736
O kɔ, a y'o wari di Bado ma.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:06.942
N'i y'o kɛ sanji tuma na, i ka kan k'o sɛnɛ. Dugukolo bena o ɲɔgɔn kɛmɛ di aw ma.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.864
Hamɛ tun bɛ siman gosira a ta lu kɔnɔ.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:36.070
Wuro nana, a sɛgɛninba. A tagara sigi muso kɔrɔ. A ka ŋuna, k'a boro kɔrɔta; a boro lanin tora bɔgɔ kan.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:44.400
Hamɛ tun b'a ka koli kɛ ka tɛmɛ a dan kan, ka taga ɲa.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.140
O kɔ, Wuro k'a boro bugɔ a ra.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:54.170
Wuro y'a ka bolo mandimi. A ka yeelen tun be yɛrɛyɛrɛla.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.878
N bɛ yafa i ma, Wuro! Ne tun ma i ye.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Dugumɔgɔw sinna ka na, o kɔ, u siranna.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:17.866
Wuro ka Hamɛ flɛ ni jusugban ye. A y'a kuun yuguyugu ka wili dɔɔni dɔɔni.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:28.050
Sankolo yɛlɛnna ni a ye san fɛ. Dɔɔni o kɔ, a kɛra lolo dɔ ye tugun.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:41.258
Ni Wuro tun tɛ yen, duniɲa bɛɛ tun bena kɛ faratiba ye. Sanji nana ban minkɛ, simanw jajara.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.520
Loon dɔ sufɛ, jinamɔgɔ dɔw tun be don boon kɔnɔ ka ben mɔgɔw kan.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.144
O jii ye ne ka denbaya ta le ye!

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:01.356
N'a sɔrɔ n' muso fana minnɔgɔ tun b'a la.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.792
Tiko fitini bana tun b'a la.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.084
Wuro, an lamɛn dɛ!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.584
Mɔgɔ si m'a jaabi.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:33.076
Nka, Wuro tun be filɛli kɛra ka bɔ sanfɛ. A k'a boro fla dayɛlɛ, ka yeelen saba bɔ dugukolo kan. A dencɛ saba.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:51.410
Sanmanamana nana ben dugu ma ni a ta bere ye. Sankabaw tun be fara ɲɔgɔn kan.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:01.024
Sanji jigira ka na, sanbɛrɛ lɔra.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:17.096
O y'a sɔrɔ Yɛli tun bɛ yaala yiritunin dɔ kɔnɔ.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:30.840
Soxo, min ye yiritu nin nin ye, ale k'a boro kɔrɔta ka taga la.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:38.194
A bɛ furaburu minw tigɛ, a b'o tigɛ. O kɔ, Tiko wilila.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.728
A laban, "Dwo" nana.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:04.370
A y'a kunbiri gwan, k'a furaburuw yuguyugu Bado ni Sanou ɲɛɛ kɔrɔ. Cɛɛ fila nunu y'u bolo sin ɲɔgɔn ma.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:14.688
O kɔ, dugumɔgɔw bɛɛ ye dɔɔn kɛ.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:35.826
Sɔgɔma wulafɛ, Hamɛ tun b'a bolow kɔrɔta tugu. A k'a ɲa kɔrɔta san fɛ, ka filɛli kɛ.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.744
Lolo dɔ y'a jaabi.
